## 优化

如果在遍历中发现 $\textit{cnt}[x] > \left\lfloor\dfrac{n}{k}\right\rfloor$，就立刻返回 $\texttt{false}$。

```py [sol-Python3]
class Solution:
    def partitionArray(self, nums: List[int], k: int) -> bool:
        n = len(nums)
        if n % k:
            return False
        cnt = [0] * (max(nums) + 1)
        n //= k  # 避免在循环中反复做除法
        for x in nums:
            cnt[x] += 1
            if cnt[x] > n:
                return False
        return True
```

```java [sol-Java]
