## 写法二：不使用字符串

```py [sol-Python3]
PRE_SUM = [0] * 1001
for i in range(1, 1001):
    def dfs(val: int, sum: int) -> bool:
        if val == 0:  # 递归终点
            return sum == i  # i 符合要求
        x = 0
        pow10 = 1
        while val:
            val, d = divmod(val, 10)
            x += d * pow10
            if dfs(val, sum + x):
                return True
            pow10 *= 10
        return False
    PRE_SUM[i] = PRE_SUM[i - 1] + (i * i if dfs(i * i, 0) else 0)

