### 迭代写法

```py [sol-Python3]
class Solution:
    def findKthBit(self, n: int, k: int) -> str:
        rev = 0  # 翻转次数的奇偶性
        while True:
            if n == 1:
                return '1' if rev else '0'
            if k == 1 << (n - 1):
                return '0' if rev else '1'
            if k > 1 << (n - 1):
                k = (1 << n) - k
                rev ^= 1
            n -= 1
