## 方法一：暴力枚举

把 $\textit{arr}$ 简记为 $A$。

暴力枚举 $i,j,k$，如果同时满足

$$
\begin{aligned}
|A_i-A_j|\le a     \\
|A_j-A_k|\le b     \\
|A_i-A_k|\le c     \\
\end{aligned}
$$

则把答案加一。

```py [sol-Python3]
class Solution:
    def countGoodTriplets(self, arr: List[int], a: int, b: int, c: int) -> int:
        n = len(arr)
        ans = 0
        for i in range(n):
            for j in range(i + 1, n):
                for k in range(j + 1, n):
                    if abs(arr[i] - arr[j]) <= a and abs(arr[j] - arr[k]) <= b and abs(arr[i] - arr[k]) <= c:
                        ans += 1
        return ans
```

